{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sulo the Sidekick</strong> is a playful desktop companion that lives right on your desktop. Place him anywhere. Work or play while your tiny friend builds his career!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Remote Work Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose career for Sulo and he works while you are active.\u00a0Remember work-life balance, yours too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/extras/Work.gif?t=1742835216\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Treat Sulo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend Sulo's earnings on fun or practical items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/extras/Shop.png?t=1742835216\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play various mini-games like fishing or catch the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/extras/Fishin.jpg?t=1742835216\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561780?t=1742835216","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561780?t=1742835216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/614f3132948f9cc68b21623346da2e4d6e79b66b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742835216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/614f3132948f9cc68b21623346da2e4d6e79b66b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742835216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sulo the Sidekick</strong> is a playful desktop companion that lives right on